    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated within the exclusive gated Casino development in the heart of Malahide Village, No. 82 is a superb two-bedroom 2nd  floor apartment offering bright, spacious accommodation in one of North Dublin's most desirable coastal locations.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented throughout, the accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a generous living and dining room, a fully fitted integrated kitchen, two spacious double bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en suite, and a main bathroom. \r\n\r\nThe apartment also benefits from dual aspect (east & west) and west-facing balcony, providing an ideal space to relax and enjoy the afternoon and evening sun. Additional features include secure resident parking and beautifully maintained communal gardens.\r\n\r\nThe Casino is an exclusive development of apartments set within mature landscaped grounds. Ideally positioned on the Dublin Road, adjacent to Malahide DART Station and directly opposite Malahide Demesne and Cricket Club, the development is just a short stroll from The Diamond and the superb selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, pubs, the marina and scenic coastal walks that Malahide has to offer.\r\n\r\nCombining spacious accommodation with a highly sought-after village location, No. 82 presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nManagement fee approx €3,365 per annum.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious two-bedroom second floor apartment\r\n\r\nPrincipal bedroom with en suite bathroom\r\n\r\nWest-facing balcony\r\n\r\nBright, well-proportioned living accommodation\r\n\r\nFully fitted integrated kitchen\r\n\r\nSecure gated development\r\n\r\nDesignated resident parking\r\n\r\nBeautifully maintained landscaped communal gardens\r\n\r\nAdjacent to Malahide DART Station / Opposite Malahide Castle Demesne and Cricket Club\r\n\r\nApproximately 350 metres from The Diamond and Malahide Village"
      },
